+<a id="aibertaihistory-import--log-only"></a>
+
+#### `aibertai/history-import` — log-only
+
+```ts persistence-catalog
+/** Required provenance and original source for an imported AIbertAI history. */
+'aibertai/history-import': { version: 1; migrationId: string; actorId: string; workspaceId: string; sourceSha256: string; source: string; messages: number }
+```
+
