+
+<a id="aibertaiinvocation--log-only"></a>
+
+#### `aibertai/invocation` — log-only
+
+```ts persistence-catalog
+/** Required record of a model invocation prepared for the AIbertAI gateway. */
+'aibertai/invocation': { invocationId: string; purpose: 'conversation' | 'compaction'; compactionId?: string }
+```
+
+Source: [`packages/core/session/src/types.ts:291`](../packages/core/session/src/types.ts)
+
+<a id="aibertaiquery-binding--log-only"></a>
+
+#### `aibertai/query-binding` — log-only
+
+```ts persistence-catalog
+/** Exact host operation that admitted one native goal command. */
+'aibertai/query-binding': { operationId: string; commandId: string; commandRunSeq: number; goalId: string; goalRevision: number; goalSeq: number }
+```
+
+Source: [`packages/core/session/src/types.ts:295`](../packages/core/session/src/types.ts)
+
+<a id="aibertaiquery-completed--log-only"></a>
+
+#### `aibertai/query-completed` — log-only
+
+```ts persistence-catalog
+/** Host recovery evidence for one goal command's completed final turn. */
+'aibertai/query-completed': { commandId: string; goalId: string; goalRevision: number; goalSeq: number; assistantSeq: number; invocationId: string; turn: number; turnEndSeq: number; finishReason: 'completed' }
+```
+
+Source: [`packages/core/session/src/types.ts:293`](../packages/core/session/src/types.ts)
+
+<a id="aibertaiworkspace-result--log-only"></a>
+
+#### `aibertai/workspace-result` — log-only
+
+```ts persistence-catalog
+/** Durable hash of the exact host-authorized workspace mutation value. */
+'aibertai/workspace-result': { operationId: string; callId: string; toolName: 'write' | 'edit'; toolCallSeq: number; toolResultSeq: number; digest: string }
+```
+
+Source: [`packages/core/session/src/types.ts:297`](../packages/core/session/src/types.ts)
