+# 2026-11-21-aibertai-failed-compaction-usage
+
+English | [中文](2026-11-21-aibertai-failed-compaction-usage.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds a log-only compaction usage record bound to the operation, invocation and compaction before shrink validation, and an optional operation identity on the invocation marker.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-11-21-aibertai-failed-compaction-usage
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:aibertai/compaction-usage"
+    previous: null
+    after: "5d5cadf95183b02c1829474f4ccd295f7e578e644939786a55e4cabd5521fd56"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:aibertai/invocation"
+    previous: "2026-11-21-aibertai-experimental-baseline"
+    after: "a6e29fc9514a666246c4f3c75030f9319a8a87a7fc87e991eab0ca0583a420e7"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+Existing histories have no usage record and remain readable. Readers that predate this required event can reject new logs containing it; use the version-pinned SDK reader. Missing or interrupted terminal evidence remains unknown and is not treated as a successful compaction.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+The SDK settlement tests reject mismatched operations, duplicate usage, missing terminal events and replacement on failure. A real SDK Goal test confirmed failed compaction incurred durable usage without a summary replacement; a host SIGKILL before acknowledgement recovered without duplicate billing.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
